    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1287">

                <pb facs="1032" n="916" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg916"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.63/96.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Agent Carothers to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gomez Palacio</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-05-19">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 19, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Referring Department’s May 17, I have no fear of enforcement of decrees. I will
                    be in Chihuahua in two days and will take matter up final adjustment but have
                    assurance that there will be no enforcement especially against foreigners.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Carothers.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
